{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44596","headline":"诗三百三首 二九三 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二九三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖迟寒岩下，偏讶最幽奇。\n携篮采山茹，挈笼摘果归。\n䔫斋敷茅坐，啜啄食紫芝。\n清沼濯瓢鉢，杂和煮稠稀。\n当阳拥裘坐，闲读古人诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}